    {
      "id": 95217,
      "field": "progress",
      "text": "Don't slack off, <name>. Smithin' isn't for the lazy!",
      "englishSHA256": "a437dc0c78c4e404b00e5df73ec1fe68f364594497ef42464bca242ae1e05c2f"
    },
    {
      "id": 95217,
      "field": "complete",
      "text": "You're a resourceful one, <name>.\n\nNow listen up - I'm not going to repeat myself!",
      "englishSHA256": "25eb49aac1d99ffddbf6d8a7ade307c35f9bfd0a24bcb6ca7c20f92fbfc46da4"
    },
    {
      "id": 95217,
      "field": "detail",
      "text": "So you're looking to learn the blacksmith's trade? Maybe we can help each other.\n\nThe supply shipment's late, and I need materials for some repairs around the camp. If you get me what I need, I'll teach you some of my techniques. Sound fair?",
